  "title": "Fantastic Homemade Pizza Sauce",
  "description": "This homemade pizza sauce knocks it out of the park with garlic, onion, red wine, and fresh herbs. The flavors develop after a long simmer and an overnight rest in the fridge.",
  "authors": [
    "JMOTT1"
  ],
